  "title": "Latest Cobalt VMs and Azure Boost enhancements​",
  "description": "Learn about the latest Cobalt VMs, the use cases they support, and how they compare to our previous generation Arm based VMs. Learn how these VMs are designed for cloud-native, scale-out applications using Linux, AKS, and other open-source software. Then explore recent performance and feature enhancements for Azure Boost, as well as recently announced general compute and confidential computing VMs that rely on Azure Boost. Learn how they can support your most latency sensitive applications.​",
